---
/**
 * NewsBanner — 以 News 形式强调兄弟院系 VeryMath，并说明集成情况
 */
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#fbfdff] px-6 py-12 sm:py-16">
  <div class="tech-dots absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-60"></div>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl relative">
    <div class="fade-in-up tech-card group relative flex flex-col gap-6 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#dbe4ff] bg-white p-6 shadow-sm sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-8 sm:p-8">
      <!-- 渐变装饰边 -->
      <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-1 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#555aff] via-[#4ca6ff] to-[#0f9f8f]" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <!-- Logo -->
      <a href="https://github.com/VeryMath" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
         class="relative shrink-0 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-[#555aff] focus-visible:outline-offset-4"
         aria-label="访问 VeryMath GitHub 主页">
        <img src="/images/partners/verymath-logo.png" alt="VeryMath Logo"
             width="88" height="88"
             class="h-16 w-16 rounded-2xl border border-[#e1e8ff] bg-white object-cover shadow-md transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105 sm:h-20 sm:w-20" />
      </a>

      <!-- 文案 -->
      <div class="flex-1">
        <div class="mb-2 inline-flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="tech-pulse inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#555aff]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#555aff]">News · 生态动态</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold leading-snug text-slate-950 sm:text-2xl">
          Inno Agent 已完成对
          <a href="https://github.com/VeryMath" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
             class="text-[#555aff] underline decoration-[#c7d0ff] decoration-2 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:decoration-[#555aff]">VeryMath</a>
          的适配与集成
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-base">
          VeryMath 是华东师范大学智能教育研究院的兄弟团队，专注面向数学的 AI 研究与教学工具。
          现在，其数学研究、论文精读、Lean 形式化证明等能力已作为工作区模板接入 Inno Agent，
          开箱即可在同一个工作台里完成数学学习与研究闭环。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <a href="https://github.com/VeryMath" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
             class="tech-cta inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#555aff] px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-[#464cf0] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-[#555aff] focus-visible:outline-offset-2">
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/></svg>
            访问 VeryMath 主页
          </a>
          <a href="#skills"
             class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-[#dfe5ff] bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:border-[#555aff] hover:text-[#555aff]">
            查看集成的工作区
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
